This repository is an academic research project artifact for UUV mission
planning, energy estimation, and validation workflow development.

The software is provided for research, review, and educational use only. It is
not an operational, tactical, safety-of-navigation, or mission-command system.
No warranty is provided, express or implied, including warranties of accuracy,
fitness for purpose, or suitability for real-world operations.

Use of this software for physical testing requires independent engineering
review, validated vehicle data, controlled test procedures, and appropriate
safety oversight.

